   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "COMEDY FROM THE MIX\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 7, CC 97 to 112\n   1 How different the personalities are\n   2 Chaos in an orderly room\n   3 Gap in rank\n   4 What the mix does to the plot\n   5 What the mix does to the characters\n   6 Laughs from the mix\n   7 The double act\n   8 The straight man\n   9 The odd one out\n  10 Clash of egos\n  11 Who knows what\n  12 Who sides with whom\n  13 The unwanted guest\n  14 Chemistry\n  15 suite: Comedy from the mix lens\n  16 suite: Straight one and funny one\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 8, CC 1 to 16\n   1 suite: Chaos agent\n   2 suite: The odd couple\n   3 suite: Calm in the madness\n   4 suite: Doesn't belong here\n   5 suite: The petty war\n   6 suite: Everyone knows but one\n   7 suite: Status swap\n   8 suite: The worst possible guest\n   9 suite: Banter\n  10 pair: When a chaos character enters an orderly room, the cringe rises\n  11 pair: When opposite personality types share the room, more of the laughs come from the mix\n  12 pair: When the gap in rank grows, the plot takes a turn\n  13 pair: Pride before a fall\n  14 pair: When the unwanted guest arrives, the room falls into chaos\n  15 pair: When the egos clash, the plot takes a detour\n  16 pair: When the one who doesn't know gets close to the secret, the cringe rises\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 8, CC 17 to 24\n   1 pair: When the chaos grows, the straight man's calm sells the laugh\n   2 pair: When the odd one out tries harder, the group pulls away\n   3 pair: When the sides switch, the status flips\n   4 pair: When the chemistry grows, the characters change\n   5 pairs: The mix makes it funny\n   6 pairs: The house party engine\n   7 pairs: The secret in the room\n   8 pairs: The pair that grows"
   },
